(5691766, 828357, 30861, '<td valign="top">Let me be the first to say "Your title has 4 words!" I was actually gonna do that myself, have a "the" in my title, but I decided the voters would hammer me for it since the challenge description says "Your film title must have the initials "DPC"... I this case, you have DaPC, I''d have had tDPC...<br/> <br/>I''m NOT scoring you down for this, and I hope the others don''t get that anal either. Feel free to PM me and let me know how it''s doing, whether the comments are mentioning this at all.<br/> <br/>Meanwhile, lovely and haunting image in its own right. I''m not sure I get the connection to "party city" (it seems rather bleak to me) but no matter...</td>', 'Let me be the first to say "Your title has 4 words!" I was actually gonna do that myself, have a "the" in my title, but I decided the voters would hammer me for it since the challenge description says "Your film title must have the initials "DPC"... I this case, you have DaPC, I''d have had tDPC... I''m NOT scoring you down for this, and I hope the others don''t get that anal either. Feel free to PM me and let me know how it''s doing, whether the comments are mentioning this at all. Meanwhile, lovely and haunting image in its own right. I''m not sure I get the connection to "party city" (it seems rather bleak to me) but no matter...', '2009-10-19 02:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
