(5691908, 827635, 100393, '<td valign="top">Clearly inspired by <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=741560" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/955/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_741560.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/955/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_741560.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/955/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_741560.jpg"/></a>. Has a real movie feel about its composition; the title is also very credible.<br/> <br/>All round - very good indeed; If I could, I''d place a bet on seeing this on the front page.</td>', 'Clearly inspired by . Has a real movie feel about its composition; the title is also very credible. All round - very good indeed; If I could, I''d place a bet on seeing this on the front page.', '2009-10-19 07:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
