(5691917, 827889, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the title stretches movie title credibility and though the picture is pretty good - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.</td>', 'I think the title stretches movie title credibility and though the picture is pretty good - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.', '2009-10-19 07:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
