(5691926, 828257, 100393, '<td valign="top">This simple setup conveys an awful lot and is very, very well executed. Lighting is perfect and the perspective on the gun is brilliant.<br/> <br/>I can certainly see this as a movie poster and on the DPC front page.<br/> <br/>Great stuff!</td>', 'This simple setup conveys an awful lot and is very, very well executed. Lighting is perfect and the perspective on the gun is brilliant. I can certainly see this as a movie poster and on the DPC front page. Great stuff!', '2009-10-19 07:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5691935, 828357, 100393, '<td valign="top">Borderline credible movie title and the image is a fair match. It is of course very well executed - HD and colour handling have a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=72103" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Dougi555</a> feel about it but in the end I''m not sure that it communicates ''movie'' to me.</td>', 'Borderline credible movie title and the image is a fair match. It is of course very well executed - HD and colour handling have a  Dougi555 feel about it but in the end I''m not sure that it communicates ''movie'' to me.', '2009-10-19 07:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5691939, 828246, 100393, '<td valign="top">Phoca as in seal? I can see that with that context, the title works in a fashion for a movie (whether it would pull the viewers in is another matter!)  Your image is a good match for the title and is well executed but I don''t think the composition or the feeling this image offers gives it a movie feel.</td>', 'Phoca as in seal? I can see that with that context, the title works in a fashion for a movie (whether it would pull the viewers in is another matter!)  Your image is a good match for the title and is well executed but I don''t think the composition or the feeling this image offers gives it a movie feel.', '2009-10-19 07:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5691940, 828294, 100393, '<td valign="top">Perhaps Michael Moore could make this title work but other than that it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.<br/> <br/>The general composition, flat lighting and dull (but important) subject matter leave me cold I''m afraid.</td>', 'Perhaps Michael Moore could make this title work but other than that it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do. The general composition, flat lighting and dull (but important) subject matter leave me cold I''m afraid.', '2009-10-19 07:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5691943, 827659, 100393, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, wonderful shot; I think a portrait crop / near square crop from the lamp post to the tip of the facing bird may have worked even better though.<br/> <br/>However, I think the title stretches movie-title credibility and though the picture is fantastic - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.<br/> <br/>I can''t bring myself to give it less than a 7 though - I can''t bring myself to be too ''DNMC'' on images this good.</td>', 'Wonderful, wonderful shot; I think a portrait crop / near square crop from the lamp post to the tip of the facing bird may have worked even better though. However, I think the title stretches movie-title credibility and though the picture is fantastic - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do. I can''t bring myself to give it less than a 7 though - I can''t bring myself to be too ''DNMC'' on images this good.', '2009-10-19 07:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
