(5692101, 828231, 100393, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, near-feasible movie title with a well matched image. Photographically this is very good indeed. I''m not sure that your layout, composition etc communicates a movie poster but a good image.</td>', 'Pretty good, near-feasible movie title with a well matched image. Photographically this is very good indeed. I''m not sure that your layout, composition etc communicates a movie poster but a good image.', '2009-10-19 10:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692102, 828305, 100393, '<td valign="top">Feasible title for a movie; though completely infeasible that a lady such as your model would ever have difficulty in finding companionship!!<br/> <br/>Photographically - very well lit, focus just a tad soft for me, I perhaps would have kept that effect (if it was software induced) off the face. The picture on the wall and the door are a little distracting - you could''ve cloned these out under advanced without falling foul of the rules.<br/> <br/>Overall - nice job.</td>', 'Feasible title for a movie; though completely infeasible that a lady such as your model would ever have difficulty in finding companionship!! Photographically - very well lit, focus just a tad soft for me, I perhaps would have kept that effect (if it was software induced) off the face. The picture on the wall and the door are a little distracting - you could''ve cloned these out under advanced without falling foul of the rules. Overall - nice job.', '2009-10-19 10:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692103, 828144, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the title could work for a artsy movie and this image works well with that vision. Given the shallow depth of field, I think nothing less than perfect sharpness of the eye is needed to really bring the image alive.<br/> <br/>Overall though, pretty good.</td>', 'I think the title could work for a artsy movie and this image works well with that vision. Given the shallow depth of field, I think nothing less than perfect sharpness of the eye is needed to really bring the image alive. Overall though, pretty good.', '2009-10-19 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692104, 828141, 100393, '<td valign="top">Credible movie title with a matching image; enough negative space for a movie poster but I can''t shake the feeling that you have undersold this vision; a more dramatic edit may have helped but you may have already pushed your source to its limits.<br/> <br/>Pretty good though.</td>', 'Credible movie title with a matching image; enough negative space for a movie poster but I can''t shake the feeling that you have undersold this vision; a more dramatic edit may have helped but you may have already pushed your source to its limits. Pretty good though.', '2009-10-19 10:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692106, 828346, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great street shot and although the title is movie-ish enough and the picture matches it, the image itself doesn''t seem like a movie poster.<br/> <br/>I really, really like the image and I don''t normally go overboard with the DNMC thing but it''s keeping me from giving you more than a 6.</td>', 'Great street shot and although the title is movie-ish enough and the picture matches it, the image itself doesn''t seem like a movie poster. I really, really like the image and I don''t normally go overboard with the DNMC thing but it''s keeping me from giving you more than a 6.', '2009-10-19 10:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692107, 828260, 100393, '<td valign="top">Tones aside (I wish this had a blue / white hue) this is a beautiful image - credible movie title? No. Does it have a poster feel? A tad.<br/> <br/>Overall, great image in the wrong box. I don''t really do the DNMC thing but for this challenge I have pegged your score back a little.</td>', 'Tones aside (I wish this had a blue / white hue) this is a beautiful image - credible movie title? No. Does it have a poster feel? A tad. Overall, great image in the wrong box. I don''t really do the DNMC thing but for this challenge I have pegged your score back a little.', '2009-10-19 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692108, 828349, 100393, '<td valign="top">A good stab at a credible title (albeit more armchair matinee than cinema blockbuster) and your image matches that title well.<br/> <br/>The technicals are pretty good and your edit is sympathetic to the subject but overall it isn''t the most movie-poster-ish entry in the challenge.</td>', 'A good stab at a credible title (albeit more armchair matinee than cinema blockbuster) and your image matches that title well. The technicals are pretty good and your edit is sympathetic to the subject but overall it isn''t the most movie-poster-ish entry in the challenge.', '2009-10-19 10:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692109, 828225, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m not one to get too worked up by DNMC but I am looking for some at least a little movie feasibility and just a tad of a poster feel....<br/> <br/>You''ve delivered a very interesting and wonderfully executed image but even the most admiring may struggle to rate this highly while respecting the challenge constraints.</td>', 'I''m not one to get too worked up by DNMC but I am looking for some at least a little movie feasibility and just a tad of a poster feel.... You''ve delivered a very interesting and wonderfully executed image but even the most admiring may struggle to rate this highly while respecting the challenge constraints.', '2009-10-19 10:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692114, 828156, 15711, '<td valign="top">A Clockwork Orange immediately came to mind.  This is funky and cool and worthy of a movie poster. The P/escher in the title is a bit of a shoe-horn. :~P</td>', 'A Clockwork Orange immediately came to mind.  This is funky and cool and worthy of a movie poster. The P/escher in the title is a bit of a shoe-horn. :~P', '2009-10-19 10:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692116, 828164, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the title stretches movie title credibility a little and though the picture is pretty well executed - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.<br/> <br/>I think the background is rather too prominent and whatever filter you have used for this tone-mapping look has left a bit of halo-ing around the gloves, something I''m never fond of.<br/> <br/>I also think your composition could have included a little more negative space - this shot but with more background and the gloves more towards the bottom right may have been for effective for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Overal though - a decent shot.</td>', 'I think the title stretches movie title credibility a little and though the picture is pretty well executed - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do. I think the background is rather too prominent and whatever filter you have used for this tone-mapping look has left a bit of halo-ing around the gloves, something I''m never fond of. I also think your composition could have included a little more negative space - this shot but with more background and the gloves more towards the bottom right may have been for effective for this challenge. Overal though - a decent shot.', '2009-10-19 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692117, 828349, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the added text. Love the image.</td>', 'Not crazy about the added text. Love the image.', '2009-10-19 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692120, 828066, 100393, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a wonderful sky but I think the title stretches movie title credibility and the picture doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.</td>', 'Nice shot with a wonderful sky but I think the title stretches movie title credibility and the picture doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.', '2009-10-19 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692122, 828325, 15711, '<td valign="top">This could be a thriller.  Starting with this gorgeous scene and then a monster comes out of the woods, created by toxic sludge in the water.  Maybe I have a vivid imagination. ROFL</td>', 'This could be a thriller.  Starting with this gorgeous scene and then a monster comes out of the woods, created by toxic sludge in the water.  Maybe I have a vivid imagination. ROFL', '2009-10-19 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692124, 828330, 100393, '<td valign="top">Funny, clever title and a great landscape shot (though the white balance looks off to me) but I think the title stretches movie title credibility just a little and though the picture is pretty good - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.</td>', 'Funny, clever title and a great landscape shot (though the white balance looks off to me) but I think the title stretches movie title credibility just a little and though the picture is pretty good - it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.', '2009-10-19 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692125, 828354, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL - that''s funny but I see it as a cute title to the image, not a movie theme.</td>', 'LOL - that''s funny but I see it as a cute title to the image, not a movie theme.', '2009-10-19 10:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
