(5692130, 828009, 100393, '<td valign="top">I can see a movie title like this coming from an adaptation of a cult science fiction book - but really it''s a bit of a stretch. It''s a pretty image for sure, but it has a smeared quality that doesn''t sit too well with me.<br/> <br/>It''s OK as an image but it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.</td>', 'I can see a movie title like this coming from an adaptation of a cult science fiction book - but really it''s a bit of a stretch. It''s a pretty image for sure, but it has a smeared quality that doesn''t sit too well with me. It''s OK as an image but it doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.', '2009-10-19 10:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692133, 828251, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the title stretches movie title credibility and though the picture is pretty good - it really doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do.<br/> <br/>However, as a photo I really like the high key handling and the wide pupils and catch-lights, though I do think the cropped vertex and pigtails might have been included.</td>', 'I think the title stretches movie title credibility and though the picture is pretty good - it really doesn''t say ''movie'' to me in the same way as some of the other entries do. However, as a photo I really like the high key handling and the wide pupils and catch-lights, though I do think the cropped vertex and pigtails might have been included.', '2009-10-19 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692134, 828338, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice going.  Really looks like a poster and the verbiage is appropos for a movie title.  This is one of my favs.</td>', 'Nice going.  Really looks like a poster and the verbiage is appropos for a movie title.  This is one of my favs.', '2009-10-19 10:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692136, 828144, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. Love the use of the single eye. She could be a serial killer on the loose. LOL  I like this a lot. Maybe my fav so far. 9</td>', 'Fabulous. Love the use of the single eye. She could be a serial killer on the loose. LOL  I like this a lot. Maybe my fav so far. 9', '2009-10-19 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692137, 828283, 15711, '<td valign="top">Certainly movie poster worthy. The title is clever and a good theme for a film.</td>', 'Certainly movie poster worthy. The title is clever and a good theme for a film.', '2009-10-19 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692140, 828131, 100393, '<td valign="top">Credible title for a quirky movie and the image reflects ''Dawn Patrol Crusaders'' - does the image have the look of a movie poster? Not for me. I do like the image though - bags of story, which is good.</td>', 'Credible title for a quirky movie and the image reflects ''Dawn Patrol Crusaders'' - does the image have the look of a movie poster? Not for me. I do like the image though - bags of story, which is good.', '2009-10-19 10:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
