(5692478, 828259, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot - the saturation works really well and the ghostly figure matches a pretty credible title. There is the right mixture of simplicity and intrigue to make for an effective movie poster.</td>', 'Very nicely shot - the saturation works really well and the ghostly figure matches a pretty credible title. There is the right mixture of simplicity and intrigue to make for an effective movie poster.', '2009-10-19 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692481, 828321, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very credible title and a well suited matching image. Plenty of negative space at the top which works well for this genre.<br/> <br/>Photographically, it doesn''t look like you had much control over anything, so it''s not your fault but I''m not fantastically keen on the hue and lighting or on looking at the rear of the a horse and the back of someones head ;-)<br/> <br/>However, it does manage to be effective in this context.</td>', 'Very credible title and a well suited matching image. Plenty of negative space at the top which works well for this genre. Photographically, it doesn''t look like you had much control over anything, so it''s not your fault but I''m not fantastically keen on the hue and lighting or on looking at the rear of the a horse and the back of someones head ;-) However, it does manage to be effective in this context.', '2009-10-19 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692482, 828196, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very funny - especially in the context of your previous work! Definitely a film I''d like to see.</td>', 'Very funny - especially in the context of your previous work! Definitely a film I''d like to see.', '2009-10-19 16:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692510, 828288, 74911, '<td valign="top">Yes, this image screams peacefulness. Nice title.</td>', 'Yes, this image screams peacefulness. Nice title.', '2009-10-19 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692542, 828157, 49954, '<td valign="top">Not poster style.  No cars (implied sure, but could be anything).  Vertical and hood of car would have worked.  Too bad, a nice idea.</td>', 'Not poster style.  No cars (implied sure, but could be anything).  Vertical and hood of car would have worked.  Too bad, a nice idea.', '2009-10-19 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
