(5692576, 828159, 49954, '<td valign="top">interesting if legit.  At least you honored the spirit of the challenge!!! Most here did not.  The (poster dimensions...) comment is unneeded and annoying.  Should have left the title as is.</td>', 'interesting if legit.  At least you honored the spirit of the challenge!!! Most here did not.  The (poster dimensions...) comment is unneeded and annoying.  Should have left the title as is.', '2009-10-19 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
