(5692609, 828187, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic! A great, credible movie title too.<br/> <br/>Photographically, I love the colours but wonder about the top crop point and the overall sharpness.</td>', 'Very dramatic! A great, credible movie title too. Photographically, I love the colours but wonder about the top crop point and the overall sharpness.', '2009-10-19 17:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5692614, 828248, 100393, '<td valign="top">Accurately titled image but it isn''t really communicating ''movie'' to me in any way.<br/> <br/>Photographically, I really don''t think there is enough to interest a viewer. I''m giving a 2 but at least you know why.</td>', 'Accurately titled image but it isn''t really communicating ''movie'' to me in any way. Photographically, I really don''t think there is enough to interest a viewer. I''m giving a 2 but at least you know why.', '2009-10-19 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
