(5693545, 828266, 83313, '<td valign="top">*Knock, knock* JPEG police here, we have a warrant.<img alt="'' . substr(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', strrpos(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/cop.gif"/> <br/> <br/>Watch your JPEG compression. You have lost a lot of clarity in this image with the use of excessive compression. There are obvious artifacts around the figure and rock he is on. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still come in under the challenge limit (200k for this one)<br/> <br/>Aside from that, it''s a well done photo, and the title sounds like a movie. I am sure it will do well, and I will be the only anal retentive voter to see the compression artifacts.</td>', '*Knock, knock* JPEG police here, we have a warrant.  Watch your JPEG compression. You have lost a lot of clarity in this image with the use of excessive compression. There are obvious artifacts around the figure and rock he is on. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still come in under the challenge limit (200k for this one) Aside from that, it''s a well done photo, and the title sounds like a movie. I am sure it will do well, and I will be the only anal retentive voter to see the compression artifacts.', '2009-10-20 14:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
