(5700638, 828266, 75192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Yup, I was pleased to see that, as anticipated, I am the only person anal enough to see those compression artifacts. Nice high score. I gave it a 7, in spite of the compression, though it might have gotten an 8 from me without it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Could you point out the areas of ''compression'' spiff? :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Yup, I was pleased to see that, as anticipated, I am the only person anal enough to see those compression artifacts. Nice high score. I gave it a 7, in spite of the compression, though it might have gotten an 8 from me without it.   Could you point out the areas of ''compression'' spiff? :)', '2009-10-26 06:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
