(5700755, 828290, 30049, '<td valign="top">Robert - I really like your photo here.  One of the reasons is that I strongly considered doing the exact same thing, including even the title!!!  I was just too lazy to go out in the wet weather and attempt it.  In retrospect I''m glad I didn''t as this shot would''ve paled any attempt I made.  Well done!</td>', 'Robert - I really like your photo here.  One of the reasons is that I strongly considered doing the exact same thing, including even the title!!!  I was just too lazy to go out in the wet weather and attempt it.  In retrospect I''m glad I didn''t as this shot would''ve paled any attempt I made.  Well done!', '2009-10-26 08:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
