(5700823, 828305, 70369, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for all the great comments... She''s an awesome gal, a lifelong friend, we met when I was 14 and still talk every week, and this shoot was just for fun.. She''s never been desperate for companionship which made it even more fun when I thought of the title.. LOL.. <br/> <br/>I''d love to hear feedback in reference from the original to the final version... I know it''s still gonna be considered soft, but I love soft portraits.. I just can''t stop myself when processing them, not matter what.. I''d make the devil look soft &amp; dreamy.. :-)..</td>', 'Thanks so much for all the great comments... She''s an awesome gal, a lifelong friend, we met when I was 14 and still talk every week, and this shoot was just for fun.. She''s never been desperate for companionship which made it even more fun when I thought of the title.. LOL..  I''d love to hear feedback in reference from the original to the final version... I know it''s still gonna be considered soft, but I love soft portraits.. I just can''t stop myself when processing them, not matter what.. I''d make the devil look soft & dreamy.. :-)..', '2009-10-26 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
