(5701097, 828140, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique club!<br/> <br/>LOLOLOL, I was going through this challenge this morning and was so excited when I saw yours and your great placement and was going to leave a comment.  But for some reason, I KNEW i was going to get this one in the CClub!!!!!<br/> <br/>As for your shot, brilliant.  The placement is strong with your score. You put so much work into this as well. The only thing I could see that you could do a little differently would be to light the audience a little more.<br/> <br/>I think this is a fun shot and it really sounds like you had a good time making it!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique club! LOLOLOL, I was going through this challenge this morning and was so excited when I saw yours and your great placement and was going to leave a comment.  But for some reason, I KNEW i was going to get this one in the CClub!!!!! As for your shot, brilliant.  The placement is strong with your score. You put so much work into this as well. The only thing I could see that you could do a little differently would be to light the audience a little more. I think this is a fun shot and it really sounds like you had a good time making it!!!! ', '2009-10-26 13:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
