(5705989, 827776, 51747, '<td valign="top">Boooo Hisssss   bad decision by the SC, for this image is truly worthy of the Blue that it earned. You and everybody else know that this image was not altered to try and take advantage of rules, etc. Technicalities suck but they are what they are. Best of luck to you on your next Blue ribbon. Hugs from Philly   GO Phils!!!</td>', 'Boooo Hisssss   bad decision by the SC, for this image is truly worthy of the Blue that it earned. You and everybody else know that this image was not altered to try and take advantage of rules, etc. Technicalities suck but they are what they are. Best of luck to you on your next Blue ribbon. Hugs from Philly   GO Phils!!!', '2009-10-29 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5705991, 827776, 60614, '<td valign="top">I am praying you find it.</td>', 'I am praying you find it.', '2009-10-29 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5706016, 827776, 37719, '<td valign="top">To hell with the DQ!  Great - Excellent photograph!  It was voted that and that is that!  Or is that supposed to be something like this or that which in that case this post would make no sense.  Or does it?  Sorry about the DQ, but never waiver in your confidence that you can produce a photograph that moves the masses as well as the few.</td>', 'To hell with the DQ!  Great - Excellent photograph!  It was voted that and that is that!  Or is that supposed to be something like this or that which in that case this post would make no sense.  Or does it?  Sorry about the DQ, but never waiver in your confidence that you can produce a photograph that moves the masses as well as the few.', '2009-10-29 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
