(5706459, 827776, 35994, '<td valign="top">Boo to the DQ, at least you know it was a winning image though. And I have learned from you! I didn''t know rotating it when you previewed it changed the original, very good to know.<br/>Beautiful image!!</td>', 'Boo to the DQ, at least you know it was a winning image though. And I have learned from you! I didn''t know rotating it when you previewed it changed the original, very good to know.Beautiful image!!', '2009-10-30 10:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
